674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ecr8vWlvk7wQ7kNvwEBVyTe&_nc_oc=AdqWfN6gBcAyNCloVVa0tHyYaSqMwS7R845P8VYDraiBecApCKDxgtoFwE1hKGl2NPE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNhjMkWb0NlcWJqPAd5UeZp5zBmQaTJaBfB0w0G-Ik26g&oe=6AD0E3D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ygO2CmYJmwEQ7kNvwE8plVi&_nc_oc=AdrZMry-dO_SElZLc1PyTXDnnZg9epFCsPbQ-E-7ipUH6hrBylUjklkWv1rm0gH6th0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNB3Jaz0yM05FLwU8l-h6O_hAlvmvjdQF23PXpami1BVQ&oe=6AD0EC96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tjfe0s0ke7IQ7kNvwHNmgT1&_nc_oc=Ado0-G-hDir27NylqB5UdoNUTBofmyGVtKYuLn537XDlm8AVPxsTzoAEB5AziaHiGYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNAOtzhrC6k8h6aIbbQcmc6j9VUn_DydvvaIrqCVhW3Aw&oe=6AD0E8B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip